# What the image build must not take from a working checkout: host
# dependencies and build output (the stages install and build their own),
# a dev instance's data and secrets, and editor and tool state. The phone
# app in mobile/ is not part of the image at all.
.git
.claude
.env
deploy/.env
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/test-results
web/playwright-report
mobile
bin
tmp
data
internal/webui/dist
